# Demo mode — `npm run dev:demo`
#
# Committed deliberately: nothing here is secret.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL points at the Vite dev server itself, so supabase-js issues
# its REST calls to http://localhost:5173/rest/v1/... where the mock middleware
# answers them. No Supabase project is contacted at any point.
#
# The key is not a JWT and grants nothing; it exists only to satisfy the client
# constructor.
#
# Sign in with  demo_owner / demo
VITE_TRACKSIMPLY_MOCK=1
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://localhost:5173
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=demo-mode-no-real-credentials